      "statusChangeNewStatus": "available in future release",
      "value": "Well, we've been working on this for a long time now - about 10 months. And I'm happy to say that the update fixing this issue has now been released to open beta! Users joining the instance will no longer cause the owner to resend all their data and get everybody clogged in extreme cases.",
